==Battleground==
*2 [[Mooth]]s spawn, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Maawth]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sister Lione]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns.
**2 [[Maawth]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring a good Anti-Red crowd-controller such as [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] or [[Witch Cat (Rare Cat)|Enchantress]]. Once the Bore dies the stage becomes a lot easier.

